---
import Titulo from "@/components/global/Titulo.astro";
import PreciosItems from "@/components/home/PreciosItems.astro";
---

<section
  class="relative bg-gym-bg bg-[url('/img/bg/bgclaroflip.webp')] bg-cover w-full py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-20 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden"
>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full pointer-events-none overflow-hidden z-0">
    <img
      src="/img/bg/fondoyellow.webp"
      alt=""
      class="w-full rotate-y-180 object-cover opacity-50 sm:opacity-70 lg:opacity-100 max-h-40 sm:max-h-56 md:max-h-72"
    />
  </div>

  <div
    class="max-w-6xl 2xl:max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10"
  >
    <div
      class="bg-secondary-800/10 backdrop-blur-xs rounded-2xl animate-fade-in-up flex flex-col justify-center items-center gap-3 z-20 px-4 sm:px-8 py-6 sm:py-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto shadow-sm"
    >
      <Titulo title="Precios" />

      <h1 class="my-2 text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-black text-center text-gym-text-primary tracking-tight">
        Elige el precio que mejor se adapte a ti
      </h1>

      <p
        class="text-gym-text-secondary text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
      >
        Da el primer paso hacia una vida más activa y saludable con precios
        accesibles diseñados para ayudarte a alcanzar tus objetivos sin
        complicaciones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <PreciosItems />
  </div>
</section>

